paragraph.content:
to the extent practicable, ensure that the public alert and warning system is resilient and secure
 and can withstand acts of
 terrorism and other external attacks;

discusses the process used by the Secretary in accepting applications, assessing candidates,
 ensuring adherence to veterans’ preference, and selecting applicants for
 vacancies to be filled by an individual for a qualified position;

coordinating the sharing of information related to cyber threat indicators, defensive measures,
cybersecurity risks, and incidents across the
 Federal Government;

facilitating cross-sector coordination to address cybersecurity risks and incidents, including
 cybersecurity risks and incidents that may be related or could have
 consequential impacts across multiple sectors;

